    "Fractions are numbers, so every fraction has a position on a number line. The key is to count intervals, not tick marks.": { src: "/fractions/audio/ryan-aceac4b98500afd9.mp3" },
    "From 0 to 1 is one whole. Split that distance into four equal intervals and each interval is one quarter.": { src: "/fractions/audio/ryan-b40745c28000145d.mp3" },
